 "title": "Careers | The Credence Group",
 "description": "The Credence Group is a holding company managing a strategic portfolio of industry players across real estate, private lending, business acquisition, advisory and consulting services.",
 "image": "",
 "body": "<section class=\"page-hero large\"><div class=\"container\"><h1>Build Your Future Within Our Ecosystem</h1><p>At The Credence Group, we invest in specialists, innovators, and leaders who are passionate about shaping the future.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Careers</span><h2>Why Professionals Choose Credence</h2></div>\n<div class=\"grid-3\"><div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 14 4 4-4 4\" /> <path d=\"m18 2 4 4-4 4\" /> <path d=\"M2 18h1.973a4 4 0 0 0 3.3-1.7l5.454-8.6a4 4 0 0 1 3.3-1.7H22\" /> <path d=\"M2 6h1.972a4 4 0 0 1 3.6 2.2\" /> <path d=\"M22 18h-6.041a4 4 0 0 1-3.3-1.8l-.359-.45\" /></svg></div><h3>Cross-Sector Mobility</h3><p>Our unique structure allows professionals to collaborate across finance, real estate, consulting, construction, media, and investment sectors.</p></div><div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\" /> <path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\" /> <path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\" /> <path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\" /></svg></div><h3>Entrepreneurial Culture</h3><p>We empower our teams with autonomy, innovation, and the freedom to create meaningful impact.</p></div><div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\" /> <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\" /></svg></div><h3>The Credence Standard</h3><p>We hire for character and develop for excellence, ensuring every team member contributes to our culture of integrity and performance.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section bg-navy center-text\"><div class=\"container narrow\"><svg class=\"icon big-gold\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\" /> <path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\" /> <path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\" /> <path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\" /> <path d=\"M3 4h8\" /></svg><span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Culture</span><h2 class=\"light\">Synergy, Not Silos</h2><p class=\"lead light\">We believe the most innovative ideas emerge at the intersection of industries. At The Credence Group, architects collaborate with lenders, consultants partner with marketers, and investors learn from operators. This exchange of expertise creates a more dynamic, informed, and effective organization.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Now Hiring</span><h2>Current Opportunities</h2><p class=\"sub\">Explore divisions across our portfolio of companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid-jobs\"><div class=\"job\"><svg class=\"icon gold-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M17 5H9.5a1 1 0 000 7h5a1 1 0 010 7H6\" /></svg><div><h3>Finance &amp; Investment</h3><p><svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg> Credence Capital / Mortgages</p></div></div><div class=\"job\"><svg class=\"icon gold-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\" /> <path d=\"M10 8h4\" /> <path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\" /> <path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\" /> <path d=\"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16\" /></svg><div><h3>Real Estate &amp; Brokerage</h3><p><svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg> Credence Realty / Real Estate</p></div></div><div class=\"job\"><svg class=\"icon gold-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 12-9.373 9.373a1 1 0 0 1-3.001-3L12 9\" /> <path d=\"m18 15 4-4\" /> <path d=\"m21.5 11.5-1.914-1.914A2 2 0 0 1 19 8.172v-.344a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414l-1.657-1.657A6 6 0 0 0 12.516 3H9l1.243 1.243A6 6 0 0 1 12 8.485V10l2 2h1.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L18.5 14.5\" /></svg><div><h3>Architecture &amp; Project Management</h3><p><svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg> Credence Design Build</p></div></div><div class=\"job\"><svg class=\"icon gold-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\" /> <rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\" /></svg><div><h3>Business Strategy &amp; Operations</h3><p><svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg> Credence Consulting</p></div></div><div class=\"job\"><svg class=\"icon gold-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" /> <path d=\"M7 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M3 7.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M3 12h18\" /> <path d=\"M3 16.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M17 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M17 7.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M17 16.5h4\" /></svg><div><h3>Creative &amp; Digital Media</h3><p><svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg> Credence Media</p></div></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"band-gold\"><div class=\"container narrow center-text\"><h2>Don't See Your Role?</h2><p>We are always looking for exceptional talent. Send your CV and a brief Value Statement to careers@credencegroup.com.</p><a class=\"btn btn-navy\" href=\"mailto:careers@credencegroup.com\">careers@credencegroup.com</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container narrow center-text\"><svg class=\"icon big-gold dark-gold\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\" /> <path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\" /> <path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\" /> <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\" /></svg><h2>Our Commitment to Diversity and Growth</h2><p class=\"lead\">The Credence Group is committed to fostering an inclusive environment where diverse perspectives drive innovation and success. We offer continuous professional development, meaningful career pathways, competitive benefits, and opportunities for leadership growth.</p></div></section>"
